<title>JAPAN: Fuji Photo - 6mth group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Fuji Photo - 6mth group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		601.14		vs	  519.40</p>
<p> Operating	   81.45		vs	   64.92</p>
<p> Pretax		81.71		vs	   65.78</p>
<p> Net		   45.09		vs	   37.62</p>
<p> EPS		   87.62 yen	  vs	   73.11 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Photo Film Co Ltd is a maker of photosensitive materials. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
